From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Draven <dravengarden@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:04:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the Cowboy managed read-only profile

A signed managed launch sets COWBOY_PRIVATE_MANAGED_PROFILE. Its
sessions are never trusted projects, expose no permission profiles,
keep the signed launch restrictions in thread configuration, run every
turn with approval `never` and a read-only, network-free sandbox, and
require Cowboy call metadata carrying the output schema. Mode changes,
native slash commands and generated titles are refused or suppressed.
An ordinary session refuses managed call metadata.

Cowboy-Delta: managed-read-only-profile
Upstream: cowboy-specific
Drop-When: Cowboy managed calls stop launching codex-acp with a managed profile
Tests: src/__tests__/CowboyManagedProfile.test.ts src/__tests__/CowboyManagedPermissionProfiles.test.ts

